---
flowchart TD
    Q([User question]) --> G{Retrieval guardrail<br/>coverage ≥ 0.35<br/>AND ≥ 2 matched terms}

    G -- "fails both" --> R1[Refuse before any LLM call<br/>fixed refusal string]
    G -- passes --> RET[Retriever<br/>700-char chunks, heading-path prefixes<br/>inverted index + tf-idf]
    RET --> SNIP[Top-k snippets]
    SNIP --> ANS[Answerer<br/>Gemini RAG prompt<br/>snippets only]
    ANS --> VER{Verifier<br/>is every claim grounded<br/>in the snippets?}

    VER -- "grounded" --> OK([Answer returned])
    VER -- "ungrounded / empty" --> EXP[Query expansion<br/>add missing domain terms]
    EXP --> RETRY{Attempts left?}
    RETRY -- yes --> RET
    RETRY -- no --> R2[Fall back to refusal<br/>or answer with caveat]

    R1 --> TRACE[(JSONL interaction trace)]
    OK --> TRACE
    R2 --> TRACE

    EVAL[[Evaluation harness<br/>pass/fail per query<br/>baseline vs new]] -.->|drives| Q
    EVAL -.->|reads| TRACE
    HUMAN([Human check<br/>review traces + model card]) -.->|audits| TRACE

    classDef guard fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d9822b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef core fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4285f4,stroke-width:2px
    classDef output fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#34a853,stroke-width:2px
    class G,VER,RETRY guard
    class RET,ANS,EXP core
    class OK,R1,R2 output
